{"3395130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Isekai Tower Defense", "steam_appid": 3395130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story of Michael, a fallen angel who defies the wrath of God and continues to love humanity. The Last Stand Of Gods begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isekai Tower Defense</strong> is a genre-blending title that fuses the strategic depth of Tower Defense with fast-paced action gameplay in an Isekai setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/aabba585c3d486b3fed565a1a52e78c8.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/aabba585c3d486b3fed565a1a52e78c8.webm?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>📖 STORY: The Wrath of God vs. Last Stand of Love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God is finally disillusioned with the <strong>foolish conflicts and selfishness of humanity</strong> recurring across every world He created. Believing &quot;My world will be peaceful without humans,&quot; God issues the final decree to gather all humans into one land and <strong>reset (annihilate)</strong> them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defying this decree, the <strong>Guardian Angel Michael</strong> chooses to uphold the former divine will to &quot;Love humanity.&quot; Michael becomes the fallen angel and dedicates himself to defending humanity's final stronghold, diving into this apocalyptic war, <strong>&quot;The Last Stand Of Gods.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>✨ GAMEPLAY FEATURES: Strategy Meets Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   🛡️ <u>Possession Action Tower Defense</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You descend as the Guardian Angel Michael and possess a human character to fight. Combine the strategic defense of the stronghold with the exhilarating <strong>fast-paced action combat</strong> of directly controlling Michael. Travel to various shrines and temples to gather Faith and empower humanity against the divine servants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/c3bc7a307ea150dac264caaad649c750.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/c3bc7a307ea150dac264caaad649c750.webm?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/c3bc7a307ea150dac264caaad649c750.mp4?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   🕸️ <u>Tactical Trap Placement</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place various <strong>traps</strong> and <strong>defensive walls</strong> along enemy invasion routes. Restrict their movement and control the battlefield to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/95544f9cbe10dd50fb2364766f45fff9.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/95544f9cbe10dd50fb2364766f45fff9.webm?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/95544f9cbe10dd50fb2364766f45fff9.mp4?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   ⚔️ <u>Combos and Class Change</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combo Attack:</strong> Execute a chain of attacks with the right timing to trigger special skills and linked abilities with increased damage. Master the rhythm to maximize your output.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Class Change:</strong> Playable characters can undergo Class Change upon reaching a certain level. Choose wisely, as your choice determines the character's core weapons, action patterns, and available skills.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/4b2a8ec4bef6c988b393a42073064e0a.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/4b2a8ec4bef6c988b393a42073064e0a.webm?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/4b2a8ec4bef6c988b393a42073064e0a.mp4?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   💎 <u>Faith-Based Upgrade System</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separate from the character's level, the Guardian Angel Michael gains and levels up through <strong>Faith</strong>. Spend acquired Faith Points on global upgrades, such as strengthening defense towers and applying powerful buffs to aid all your characters and the defense line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>  🌍 WORLD &amp; ENEMIES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Setting:</strong> The &quot;Land of Final Judgment&quot;—a fused world where multiple creations of God have been gathered.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies (Shibito):</strong> Humans whose souls have been extracted by God's servants become aggressive, monstrous <strong>&quot;Walking Dead (Shibito)&quot;</strong> that relentlessly attack the final human stronghold.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/099934cc3b049db381287622d11f6fb5.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=780 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/099934cc3b049db381287622d11f6fb5.webm?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/099934cc3b049db381287622d11f6fb5.mp4?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>  🏹 The Time of Judgment</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Against the divine wrath, can your love be the final hope for humanity?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The time of judgment begins now in <i>Isekai Tower Defense: The Last Stand Of Gods</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**<strong>Add <i>Isekai Tower Defense</i> to your Steam Wishlist and prepare for the final war!</strong>**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/aabba585c3d486b3fed565a1a52e78c8.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/aabba585c3d486b3fed565a1a52e78c8.webm?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The story of Michael, a fallen angel who defies the wrath of God and continues to love humanity. The Last Stand Of Gods begins.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Isekai Tower Defense</strong> is a genre-blending title that fuses the strategic depth of Tower Defense with fast-paced action gameplay in an Isekai setting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/aabba585c3d486b3fed565a1a52e78c8.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/aabba585c3d486b3fed565a1a52e78c8.webm?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>📖 STORY: The Wrath of God vs. Last Stand of Love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >God is finally disillusioned with the <strong>foolish conflicts and selfishness of humanity</strong> recurring across every world He created. Believing &quot;My world will be peaceful without humans,&quot; God issues the final decree to gather all humans into one land and <strong>reset (annihilate)</strong> them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defying this decree, the <strong>Guardian Angel Michael</strong> chooses to uphold the former divine will to &quot;Love humanity.&quot; Michael becomes the fallen angel and dedicates himself to defending humanity's final stronghold, diving into this apocalyptic war, <strong>&quot;The Last Stand Of Gods.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>✨ GAMEPLAY FEATURES: Strategy Meets Action</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   🛡️ <u>Possession Action Tower Defense</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You descend as the Guardian Angel Michael and possess a human character to fight. Combine the strategic defense of the stronghold with the exhilarating <strong>fast-paced action combat</strong> of directly controlling Michael. Travel to various shrines and temples to gather Faith and empower humanity against the divine servants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/c3bc7a307ea150dac264caaad649c750.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/c3bc7a307ea150dac264caaad649c750.webm?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/c3bc7a307ea150dac264caaad649c750.mp4?t=1768567185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>   🕸️ <u>Tactical Trap Placement</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategically place various <strong>traps</strong> and <strong>defensive walls</strong> along enemy invasion routes. Restrict their movement and control the battlefield to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/95544f9cbe10dd50fb2364766f45fff9.poster.avif?t=1768567185\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3395130/extras/95544f9cbe10dd50fb2364766f45fff9.webm?t=17685671